+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                               RDG.pd — Object Mapping                                |
|                     Relational Dynamic Geometry in Pure Data                         |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+

SID_STRUCTURE  (geometry / adjacency / relational basis)
------------------------------------------------------------------
[table]              — stores node positions, adjacency weights
[text]               — stores relational metadata
[list]               — passes node/edge lists between operators
[route]              — dispatches structural messages
[pack]/[unpack]      — build/parse relational tuples
[expr]               — compute adjacency ratios, relational metrics
[trigger]            — enforce deterministic ordering (t b f)

SID_INTERACTION  (tension / coupling / adjacency modulation)
------------------------------------------------------------------
[expr]               — compute tension functions
[line]/[vline]       — smooth transitions in relational tension
[* ] [+ ] [- ]       — adjust tension magnitudes
[clip]               — enforce interaction bounds
[select]             — detect threshold crossings
[spigot]             — gate interactions based on conditions
[metro]              — periodic interaction updates

SID_DYNAMICS  (motion / evolution / relational flow)
------------------------------------------------------------------
[bang]               — drive discrete evolution steps
[metro]              — continuous evolution clock
[delay]              — temporal spacing for dynamic updates
[expr]               — compute dynamic flow equations
[osc~]               — optional audio-based dynamic modulation
[phasor~]            — continuous relational motion driver
[snapshot~]          — convert audio-rate dynamics to control-rate
[env~]               — measure dynamic energy levels

RDG_STATE  (shared state container)
------------------------------------------------------------------
[text]               — store full RDG state (nodes, edges, tensions)
[list store]         — maintain evolving relational lists
[tabwrite]           — write dynamic geometry into tables
[tabread]            — read geometry for downstream modules

FLOW (inside rdg.pd)
------------------------------------------------------------------
[SYSTEM_init]
    |
    v
[SID_STRUCTURE] --> [SID_INTERACTION] --> [SID_DYNAMICS]
    |                    |                    |
    v                    v                    v
                 [RDG_STATE] (shared container)

